# Overview

包含开屏广告的类。

## Class Summary

|Class|Description|
|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:----------------------------------------|
|[SplashAd](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashad-0000001050066881)|开屏广告Ad对象。|
|[SplashAdDisplayListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashaddisplaylistener-0000001050066885)|开屏广告展示监听器。|
|[SplashView](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashview-0000001050066883)|开屏广告视图，用于获取广告，获取到广告后，SDK会自动根据配置处理和展示广告素材。|
|[SplashView.SplashAdLoadListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashview-splashadloadlistener-0000001050064936)|开屏广告加载监听器。|
|[SplashLoadListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashloadlistener-0000001989775133)|开屏广告请求状态监听器。|
|[SplashListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/splashlistener-0000001989655329)|开屏状态监听器。|

